.TH ngx-check 1  "ngx-check " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-check \- Check every site for monitoring/cron: down sites, expired or expiring certificates, renewal problems
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-check\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-5xx\fR] [\fB\-\-notify\fR] [\fB\-\-notify\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-mail\fR] [\fB\-\-always\fR] [\fB\-\-install\-timer\fR] [\fB\-\-every\fR] [\fB\-\-remove\-timer\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check every site for monitoring/cron: down sites, expired or expiring certificates, renewal problems
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print JSON
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
No output, only the exit status
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-5xx\fR \fI<PERCENT>\fR [default: 5]
Warn when more than this percentage of a site\*(Aqs requests failed with 5xx in the last 24h
.TP
\fB\-\-notify\fR \fI<URL>\fR
POST a plain\-text report to this URL (ntfy\-style: Title/Priority headers). Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-notify\-json\fR \fI<URL>\fR
POST a JSON report ({"text", "content", "status", "problems"}: Slack, Mattermost, Discord…). Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-mail\fR \fI<ADDRESS>\fR
Email the report through the local sendmail. Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-always\fR
Notify on every run with problems (default: only when the problems change, and once when all is resolved)
.TP
\fB\-\-install\-timer\fR
Install a systemd timer (or cron job) that runs this check with the same options
.TP
\fB\-\-every\fR \fI<INTERVAL>\fR [default: 1h]
How often the timer runs: 15m, 30m, 1h, 6h, 1d…
.TP
\fB\-\-remove\-timer\fR
Remove the timer installed with \-\-install\-timer
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Exit status: 0 all good, 1 warnings, 2 a site is down or a certificate expired/missing.

Notifications are sent when the problems change (and once when all is resolved), not on every run.

Examples:
  ngx check
  ngx check \-\-json
  ngx check \-\-notify https://ntfy.sh/my\-secret\-topic
  ngx check \-\-notify\-json https://hooks.slack.com/services/…
  sudo ngx check \-\-install\-timer \-\-every 1h \-\-notify https://ntfy.sh/my\-secret\-topic \-\-mail you@example.com
